{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Dr. Morris, thank you for the opportunity to share my findings. My inspection of the science wing, completed this week, identified nine separate classrooms that each need a monitor because they have separate ventilation zones. I should note that the room-by-room report has not yet been entered into the purchasing worksheet, which is why this information hasn't been reflected in the preliminary discussions. Based on these findings, the six-monitor package would leave three classrooms unmonitored, and I'd recommend we seriously consider the nine-monitor package to ensure complete coverage."}
```

